 from interviewer conditioning contact on positive review response.\\n- Sentiment: negative (threat/coercion)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (explicit request \\\"need help dealing with this\\\")\\n- Serious concern: yes (threat qualifies as serious concern requiring escalation)\\n- Testimonial potential: no (serious concern, negative experience)\\n\\n**DEV-026:** Explicit strong praise (\\\"couldn't have been more helpful\\\") with specific concrete actions: switched to online, maintained panel continuity, provided settling time.\\n- Sentiment: positive\\n- Follow-up needed: no\\n- Serious concern: no\\n- Testimonial potential: yes (clear favorable experience, specific examples, strong endorsement)\\n\\n**DEV-027:** Positive evaluation (\\\"really helpful\\\") with specific concrete actions: same platform switch, same interviewers maintained, settling time provided.\\n- Sentiment: positive\\n- Follow-up needed: no\\n- Serious concern: no\\n- Testimonial potential: yes (clear favorable experience, specific examples, explicit positive evaluation)\\n\\n**DEV-028:** Explicit positive evaluation of interview experience (\\\"efficient and respectful\\\") with clear statement of no process criticism, separate from hiring outcome disappointment.\\n- Sentiment: positive\\n- Follow-up needed: no (hiring outcome, not process issue)\\n- Serious concern: no\\n- Testimonial potential: no (favorable but generic descriptors lack concrete example)\\n\\n**DEV-029:** Restaurant review with no connection to recruitment experience.\\n- Sentiment: insufficient_information (off-topic)\\n- Follow-up needed: insufficient_information (off-topic)\\n- Serious concern: insufficient_information (off-topic)\\n- Testimonial potential: insufficient_information (off-topic)\\n\\n**DEV-030:** Candidate reports accessibility issue from assessment supposedly addressed, but explicitly cannot determine whether resolution means reassessment or just administrative closure.\\n- Sentiment: mixed (problem occurred + attempted remedy, but unresolved)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (explicit uncertainty about resolution requiring clarification)\\n- Serious concern: insufficient_information (accessibility issue specifically alleged but underspecified; nature and resolution unclear)\\n- Testimonial potential: no (problematic experience, unclear resolution)\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVcGqke1Dcvd6L1KGzAC\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"input_tokens\":3342,\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"request_id\":\"req_011CfVcGqJb5Kn3r95LKp7Zd\",\"session_id\":\"ce9c6a15-c267-45a0-b11c-b3f251ae0c8f\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-28T09:35:28.421Z\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"20902867-9a94-430b-a428-e540e82d0bad\"},{\"message\":{\"container\":null,\"content\":[{\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"},\"id\":\"toolu_01VHmUNLpxvymZsryMXGnq6t\",\"input\":{\"records\":[{\"follow_up_needed\":\"yes\",\"id\":\"DEV-021\",\"sentiment\":\"negative\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"no\",\"testimonial_potential\":\"no\"},{\"follow_up_needed\":\"yes\",\"id\":\"DEV-022\",\"sentiment\":\"negative\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"yes\",\"testimonial_potential\":\"no\"},{\"follow_up_needed\":\"no\",\"id\":\"DEV-023\",\"sentiment\":\"neutral\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"no\",\"testimonial_potential\":\"no\"},{\"follow_up_needed\":\"no\",\"id\":\"DEV-024\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"no\",\"testimonial_potential\":\"yes\"},{\"follow_up_needed\":\"yes\",\"id\":\"DEV-025\",\"sentiment\":\"negative\",\"serious_concern_reported\":\"yes\",\"testim